# candor dogfoods itself: CI's Self-guard step compares candor's current effect surface against the
# committed baseline here. Track the per-crate report baselines + the engine-version stamp; everything
# else under .candor/ (live reports, state, the calibrated/encountered coverage sidecars) is
# regenerated on every run and stays untracked.
*
!.gitignore
!baseline.candor-version
!baseline.candor.Cdylib.json
!baseline.candor_report.Rlib.json
!baseline.build_script_build.Executable.json
